    oa:note "\"it was agreed that the Chi Herculis system would become an MPA Protectorate.\" Dated by the preceding sentence, 'In the 6590s AT a squadron of MPA Liberator B Series Autowars repulsed Negentropist forces... and advanced on Ridgewell.' Agreed between the Guardians of Bios League, Mao-UbiCol and House Stevens; 'the 6590s', entered as 6590." ;
